    'gondola: open shelves; fridge: one face behind glass doors with light strips and a lit header; freezer: a chest with goods lying in the well under sliding glass lids (depth is the whole width, only the first level is used: the well floor); pegboard: goods hanging on rows of hooks (levels are the hook rows, depth the hook length); stack: a floor display stacked in tapering blocks on a platform (only the first level is used: the platform top; depth is the stack depth; centered); deli: a black counter with a white quartz front ledge and rows of bowls and plates in a sunken black tray, gold heat lamps every bay above (only the first level is used: the tray top; height is the bottom of the lamp shades; depth is the whole counter); pallet: whole cases stacked straight up to the height on a wooden pallet, each layer a little off, some taken from the top; one kind of goods per pallet (only the first level is used: the pallet top; length and depth are the size of the load; centered; wood grain when boardColor is set)': '货架：敞开的层板；立式冷柜：单面，玻璃门后面，门框上有灯带，顶上一条灯箱；卧式冰柜：货躺在槽里，上面玻璃推拉盖（depth 是整个柜子的宽，只用第一层：槽底的高）；挂钩架：商品挂在一排排挂钩上（levels 是每排挂钩的高，depth 是钩长）；堆头：台子上一块块码成往上收的垛（只用第一层：台面的高；depth 是垛的深；原点在中心）；熟食柜：黑柜体、前面白石英台面，下沉的黑托盘上成排摆碗盘，上面每隔 bay 一盏金色的保温灯（只用第一层：托盘面的高；height 是灯罩底的高；depth 是整个柜子的深）；码垛：木托盘上整箱的货直上直下码到 height，每层错开一点，最上面一层被拿走一些；一个托盘一种货（只用第一层：托盘面的高；length、depth 是货垛的大小；原点在中心；写了 boardColor 的托盘带木纹）',
    'text on the lit header of a fridge (needs the font)': '冷柜顶上灯箱的字（要有字体）',
    'checkout counter (belt, scanner, register screens, a lit number sign above), shopping cart, hand basket, coin locker, entrance gate, ceiling track with spotlight heads (origin at the top of the rail; the lights that light things are placed by the scene at trackSpots), self-checkout kiosk (customer at +Z: scanner glass, lit touch screen, receipt printer with a strip of paper, card reader, bagging scale with a bag rack holding an open bag, a numbered status light pole)': '收银台（传送带、扫码台、收银机的屏、上方发光的号码牌）、购物车、购物篮、寄存柜、入口闸机、吸顶的轨道射灯（原点在轨道顶面；照亮东西的灯由场景按 trackSpots 放）、自助收银机（顾客在 +Z：扫码玻璃、发光的触摸屏、吐出一截小票的出票口、刷卡器、称重台上撑着打开的袋子的购物袋架、带号码的指示灯柱）',
    'main color (sRGB #rrggbb; by type when missing)': '主色（sRGB 的 #rrggbb；没写时按种类）',
    'checkout: mirrored, the cashier and the register screen on -Z and the customers on +Z (checkouts come in both hands; by a wall the cashier stands with the back to it)': '收银台左右镜像：收银员、收银机的屏在 -Z，顾客在 +Z（收银台有左右两种，摆在墙边时收银员背靠墙）',
    'vector atlas (content path of <path>.vector): the base color texture drawn from its curves up close, sharp at any distance; written by the bakers of merged shelves and piles': '矢量贴图（`<路径>.vector` 的内容路径）：近处按曲线画基础色贴图，走多近都清楚；合并的货架、堆放由烘焙写上',
    'number on the checkout sign (needs the font)': '收银台灯箱上的号码（要有字体）',
