    'paper tags (white or yellow, red price) or electronic shelf labels (a small housing with an e-ink screen, black price and a QR code, some with a red promo bar)': '纸价签（白底或黄底、红字）或电子价签（小外壳加一块墨水屏：黑字、二维码，有的带红色促销条）',
