    'width (diameter for bottles, cans, jars, tubs and bowls), height, depth (cartons, pouches and plates; produce: elongated when given)': '宽（瓶、罐、桶、碗是直径）、高、深（纸盒、袋、盘的厚度或进深；果蔬写了就是扁的、长的）',
    'font of the label text (Shared/Fonts/ZCOOLQingKeHuangYou from @stride-ts/assets has Chinese); no text without one': '标签上的字用的字体（资源包 @stride-ts/assets 的 Shared/Fonts/ZCOOLQingKeHuangYou 有中文）；没有时不画字',
