    'print details: emblem, ingredient pictures, fine print, badge, trim lines and shading of the band; false draws only the color blocks, pattern and text (a cartoon look)': '标签印得细不细：徽标、配料小图、细字、角标、色带的镶边和明暗；false 只画色块、底纹和字（卡通的样子）',
    'trim lines and emblem color (gold, white or off-white) (sRGB #rrggbb; picked from the seed when missing)': '镶边和徽标的颜色（金、白或米白；sRGB 的 #rrggbb；没写时按种子挑）',
