    'opacity a voxel collects before it counts as solid (one lone opaque splat is not a wall)': '一格攒到多少不透明度算实心（孤零零一个不透明的泼溅不算墙）',
    'connected solid pieces with fewer voxels are dropped (floaters)': '连着的实心块少于这么多格的去掉（飘着的噪点）',
    'also generate a simplified proxy mesh (<name>.proxy model) for collision, shadows, ray tracing and sky occlusion: give it a model component with visibleInCamera off and a static mesh collider; not generated when missing': '再生成简化的代理网格（<名字>.proxy 模型），碰撞、阴影、光追和天空遮挡用：挂一个关掉 visibleInCamera 的模型组件和静态的网格碰撞体；没写不生成',
    'drawn in camera views; turn off to only cast shadows and be part of ray tracing and sky occlusion (the proxy mesh of a scan, whose picture is the splats)': '画进相机的画面；关掉只投阴影、进光追和天空遮挡（扫描场景的代理网格：画面上是泼溅）',
    'where the tags sit: on a strip below the board front (strip) or slid behind a clear plastic rail standing on the board front, leaning back a little (rail; no strip under the board)': '价签放在哪：层板前沿往下的价签条（strip），或立在层板前沿、略往后仰的透明挡条后面（rail，层板下面没有价签条）',
    'color of a block on the right of paper tags (sRGB #rrggbb, the store color): all tags white with dark grey prices then; white or yellow with red prices when missing': '纸价签右边一块的颜色（sRGB #rrggbb，超市自己的颜色）：写了时价签都是白底深灰字；没写是白底或黄底红字',
    'thickness of the boards (wooden boards often have a 4 cm thick front)': '层板的厚（木层板前沿常有 4 厘米厚）',
    'products per level (from the bottom, like levels): a level only takes these (stores often keep one kind per level); missing or null levels use products': '按层摆的商品（从下往上，同层高）：这一层只从这些里挑（超市里一层常是一类货）；没写、null 的层用 products',
    'fridge: color of the door frames, the front below the doors, the top and the header box (sRGB #rrggbb; branded drink fridges are yellow, red...); dark frames and a blue header when missing': '冷柜：门框、门下的前脸、顶盖和灯箱的颜色（sRGB #rrggbb；饮料厂家的品牌冷柜，黄的、红的……）；没写是深灰门框、蓝灯箱',
    'exposure compensation in stops': '曝光补偿（档）',
    'color temperature of the light in the scan: that white becomes white': '扫描时光的色温：这个色温的白调成白',
    'magenta (+) or green (-) shift of that white': '那个白往品红（+）、绿（−）偏多少',
    'saturation (0 is grey)': '饱和度（0 是灰）',
    'color adjustment of the scan (scans differ in exposure and white balance), in linear light': '扫描的调色（几段扫描的曝光、白平衡不一样），在线性空间里算',
    'main ingredient color (sRGB #rrggbb)': '主料的颜色（sRGB 的 #rrggbb）',
    'side ingredient color (red pepper, scallion; sRGB #rrggbb); a darker main color when missing': '配料的颜色（红椒、葱花；sRGB 的 #rrggbb）；没写时按主料暗一些',
    'sauce under the food (sRGB #rrggbb); the main color darkened when missing': '菜底下汤汁的颜色（sRGB 的 #rrggbb）；没写时按主料暗一些',
    'how high the food reaches the wall (0..1 of the inner depth)': '菜面边上到内壁多高（按碗的深度，0..1）',
    'how much the middle heaps up (fraction of the ware height)': '中间再鼓起多少（按器皿的高）',
    'how handled the package looks (0..1): each variant fades a little and gets a few grimy smudges and scuffs near the edges, from the seed; 0 is fresh from the factory; produce and ware ignore it': '旧了多少（0..1）：每个变体按种子褪一点色、沾几块灰、边上几道擦痕；0 是刚出厂；果蔬、器皿不看它',
    'how messy the stock is: round bottles and jars turned (labels facing different ways), boxes tilted a little, some columns pushed back, small shifts within the gaps; 0 is factory tidy': '摆得多乱：圆的瓶罐转过（标签朝向不一）、盒子歪一点、有的列被往里推、在缝里错开一点；0 是出厂一样整齐',
    'sticker color (sRGB #rrggbb)': '贴纸的底色（sRGB 的 #rrggbb）',
