    'continuous collision detection: sweeps the motion of each step so fast small bodies (bullets, debris) do not pass through thin walls; costs more': '连续碰撞检测：沿每一步的位移扫过去找碰撞，快的小东西（子弹、碎块）不穿过薄墙；更费一些',
    'how many real pieces (by pieces: chunks, strands, beans; not smooth) are dropped on top and settled with physics when baking; 0 draws the food only on the surface texture': '菜面上再落下去几块真的（按样子：块、丝、粒；糊不落），烘焙时用物理让它们停下；0 是菜只画在菜面的贴图上',
    'size of one dropped piece in meters: chunk edge, strand thickness (strands are 10..16 times as long), bean length; 0.02, 0.004, 0.009 when missing': '落下去的一块多大（米）：块的边长、丝的粗细（长是 10～16 倍）、粒的长；没写是 0.02、0.004、0.009',
    'what the food looks like: chunks (braised pork, fried chicken), strands (shredded potato, bean sprouts), beans (peanuts, soybeans), smooth (mashed, custard)': '菜的样子：chunks 块（红烧肉、炸鸡块）、strands 丝（土豆丝、豆芽）、beans 粒（花生、毛豆）、smooth 糊（土豆泥、蛋羹）',
    'a dish of food in a bowl or plate; empty ware when missing': '碗、盘里盛的一份菜；没写是空的',
    'label pattern (floral: blue-and-white porcelain bands for ware); picked from the seed when missing, ware: bowls floral, plates plain': '标签的底纹（floral：器皿的青花纹带）；没写时按种子挑，器皿是碗青花、盘素白',
    'material (roughness, metalness); by shape when missing: cartons paper, cans metal, jars glass, produce skin, ware ceramic, others plastic': '材料（粗糙度、金属度）；没写时按外形：纸盒是纸，罐是金属，广口瓶是玻璃，果蔬是表皮，器皿是瓷，别的是塑料',
    'random seed of everything not written: another number is another brand of the same product': '没写的那些的随机种子：换一个数是同一类商品的另一个牌子',
